6 | Snowball Earth and Climate Extremes | Budyko (1969)\nPierrehumbert et al. (2011)\nHoffman (2019)\n ||
7 | Mars: A Wet Past? | Vertesi (2015), Intro. from /See Like A Rover/\nMcMahon et al. (2018)\nCitron et al. (2018)\nWang and Huang (2024)||
8 | Venus: A Failed Earth? | Way and Del Genio (2020)\nKrissansen-Totton et al. (2021)\nSalvador et al. (2023) ||
